    "Help me draft a message. Ask who it is for, what I want to say, and the tone. Prepare a draft for me to review.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "帮我起草一条消息。先问我收件人是谁、想表达什么、希望用什么语气，再写一份初稿给我看。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Help me plan my day. Ask about my priorities and available time, then suggest a realistic plan.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "帮我安排今天的计划。先问问我最重要的事和可用时间，再给我一份可行的安排。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Help me turn an idea into a practical plan. Ask about my goal and constraints, then break it into manageable next steps.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
